eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/86ee339ecf3ec07b791f5a4fc44bcc45.poster.avif?t=1754318749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/86ee339ecf3ec07b791f5a4fc44bcc45.webm?t=1754318749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/86ee339ecf3ec07b791f5a4fc44bcc45.mp4?t=1754318749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use An Arsenal Of unique Gadgets to call in Cluster Strikes, Mounted Turrets, Vehicles, and more! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/3dab49785013d0dd6a4aa7a41045e933.poster.avif?t=1754318749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/3dab49785013d0dd6a4aa7a41045e933.webm?t=1754318749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164080/extras/3dab49785013d0dd6a4aa7a41045e933.mp4?t=1754318749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
